Hi,

I have rebased the branches of the renesas tree which are targeted
at v3.18 on top of v3.17-rc1. I have also tagged and pushed updated
devel and next branches.

I have changed my tagging scheme slightly for this release,
the date now comes before rather than after the mainline base version.

e.g. renesas-devel-20140817-v3.17-rc1

This allows the tags to be more easily sorted by date.
